  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening labour migration governance in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports Sierra Leone&apos;s efforts to strengthen safe, regular, and orderly labour migration. It works with government institutions, recruitment agencies, and community stakeholders to improve migration governance, promote ethical recruitment practices, and enhance protection for migrant workers. The initiative also supports the development of services and information resources that help prospective migrants make informed decisions and access safe migration opportunities, contributing to better outcomes for migrants, their families, and communities.</narrative>
  </description>
